Let me set the scene;
You've played this game for about 3 years before it even came to steam, and still now when it has over 10,000 very positive reviews you feel that its had such a positive impact on your life (it doesnt contribute to your career or hunt for sexual partners in any way) you feel like you owe it at least as much as a genuine review. I travel with work, and ever since I got this game I have always made sure I have this game ready to go on my laptop with the latest version. At the very least this game has helped me realise what a terrbile human I am when confronted with situations out of the norm.
If you buy this game, it will help you to develop your self-loathing and misanthropy further. 10/10.

